# Thai Invoice Extraction System - Cursor/Claude Rules
# Version: 1.0
# Last Updated: May 2026
# Format: Markdown (.cursorrules - new 2025 format)

## 🎯 PROJECT OVERVIEW

**Project Name:** Thai Invoice Extraction System
**Description:** Production-grade AI-powered Thai invoice/document data extraction using Gemini Vision API with real-time validation, multi-page support, and comprehensive error handling

**Target Environment:** Production (enterprise-grade)
**Development Status:** Initial Build Phase

---

## 📋 SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE

### High-Level Architecture
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     FRONTEND (React 19 + TypeScript)             │
│  - InvoiceUpload component with drag-drop                        │
│  - Real-time error popups via WebSocket                          │
│  - Token usage dashboard                                          │
│  - Mobile responsive (Tailwind CSS v4)                           │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │ HTTPS/WSS
                           ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              BACKEND (Node.js 24 LTS + Express 4.21+)             │
│  - Express server with strict validation                         │
│  - 4 REST API endpoints                                           │
│  - WebSocket for real-time notifications                         │
│  - JWT authentication                                             │
│  - File upload processing                                         │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │ TCP/SSL
                           ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         SERVICE LAYER (GeminiExtractionService)                   │
│  - Gemini Vision API integration                                  │
│  - Thai text preservation (exact character-by-character)         │
│  - 14-field data extraction                                       │
│  - Validation engine                                              │
│  - Error classification (9 types)                                 │
│  - Token counting & cost calculation                              │
│  - Auto-retry with exponential backoff                            │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │ HTTPS
                           ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│        EXTERNAL: Google Gemini Vision API (gemini-2.0-flash)     │
│  - Image-to-text extraction                                       │
│  - JSON response parsing                                          │
│  - Token usage tracking                                           │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         DATABASE (PostgreSQL 17 with PostGIS extensions)         │
│  ├─ thai_invoices (16 fields + metadata)                         │
│  ├─ api_error_logs (9+ error types)                              │
│  ├─ api_token_usage (billing & analytics)                        │
│  ├─ api_retry_queue (auto-retry management)                      │
│  ├─ api_pricing_config (cost tracking)                           │
│  ├─ api_health_metrics (daily analytics)                         │
│  ├─ audit_logs (compliance & tracking)                           │
│  ├─ invoice_files (file management)                              │
│  └─ validation_rules (config-driven validation)                  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              FILE STORAGE (Local with S3 ready)                   │
│  ├─ uploads/temp/ (processing queue)                             │
│  ├─ uploads/success/ (processed invoices)                        │
│  ├─ uploads/failed/ (failed extractions)                         │
│  └─ uploads/json/ (cron pickup for downstream)                   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

