### Runtime & Package Management
- **Node.js:** 24.15.0 LTS (Krypton) - Active LTS until 2028-05-31
- **npm:** 11.12.1+ (bundled with Node.js)
- **Package Manager:** npm (no yarn/pnpm to reduce complexity)

### Backend (Production)
- **Framework:** Express 4.21.2+
- **Language:** TypeScript 5.7.2+
- **Database Driver:** pg 8.13.1+ (PostgreSQL native)
- **ORM/Query Builder:** None (use parameterized queries directly for security & performance)
- **Database:** PostgreSQL 17.2+ (latest production release)
- **Validation:** Zod 3.24.2+ (TypeScript-first schema validation)
- **File Handling:** multer 1.4.5-lts.1+
- **WebSocket:** ws 8.19.0+ (native WebSocket library)
- **Env Vars:** dotenv 16.4.7+
- **UUID Generation:** uuid 10.0.0+
- **Cron Jobs:** node-cron 3.0.3+
- **Logging:** winston 3.15.0+ or pino 9.6.0+ (structured JSON logging)
- **Security:** 
  - jsonwebtoken 9.1.2+
  - helmet 7.2.0+ (HTTP security headers)
  - cors 2.8.5+
  - express-rate-limit 7.8.1+

### Frontend (React 19)
- **React:** 19.2.6+ (latest, with React Compiler support)
- **React DOM:** 19.2.6+
- **Language:** TypeScript 5.7.2+
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 4.2.4+
- **Component Library:** Headless UI 2.2.1+ (unstyled, accessible components)
- **Form Handling:** React Hook Form 7.54.0+ (lightweight, performant)
- **HTTP Client:** axios 1.7.9+ (with automatic request/response interceptors)
- **State Management:** None (use React Context + hooks for simplicity)
- **WebSocket Client:** Socket.io-client 4.8.1+ (with auto-reconnect)
- **Icons:** Lucide React 0.451.0+
- **Notifications:** Sonner 2.1.2+ (toast notifications)
- **Build Tool:** Vite 6.1.0+ (faster than CRA, better DX)

### AI & ML
- **Gemini API:** @google/generative-ai 0.21.1+
- **Vision Model:** gemini-2.0-flash-exp (latest available)

### Development & Testing
- **Linting:** ESLint 9.15.0+
- **Code Formatter:** Prettier 3.4.2+
- **Testing Framework:** Vitest 3.0.1+ (Vite-native, 5-10x faster than Jest)
- **API Testing:** Postman 14.0+
- **Load Testing:** Apache JMeter or k6 2.1.0+
- **Security Scanning:** 
  - npm audit
  - Snyk 1.1412.0+
  - OWASP dependency-check

### Database Tools
- **Admin Client:** pgAdmin 4 (web-based)
- **Query Editor:** DBeaver 24.3.0+
- **Migration Tool:** Flyway 10.17.0+ or custom Node scripts
- **Monitoring:** pgAdmin alerts + custom queries

### DevOps & Deployment
- **Containerization:** Docker 27.0+, Docker Compose 2.30+
- **Cloud Platform:** AWS/GCP/Azure (Kubernetes-ready architecture)
- **CI/CD:** GitHub Actions (native, no 3rd party needed)
- **Monitoring:** Prometheus + Grafana (optional, add later)
- **Logging:** ELK Stack (Elasticsearch + Logstash + Kibana) or Datadog

