## 🚀 DEPLOYMENT & OPERATIONS

### Environment Management
- **Development:** .env (local, not committed)
- **Staging:** Environment variables in deployment platform
- **Production:** Secrets manager (AWS/GCP/Azure), no .env files

### Database Migrations
- Use Flyway or custom Node.js scripts
- Version all migrations (001_initial_schema.sql)
- Test migrations on staging before production
- Maintain rollback scripts for every migration

### Monitoring & Observability
- **Logs:** Structured JSON (winston/pino)
- **Metrics:** Prometheus-compatible endpoints
- **Alerts:** 
  - Error rate > 5% in last 5 minutes
  - API response time p95 > 1 second
  - Database connection pool exhausted
  - Failed validations > 100/hour

### Backup & Disaster Recovery
- PostgreSQL: daily backups, 30-day retention
- Uploads: backup to S3/GCS weekly
- RTO (Recovery Time Objective): 1 hour
- RPO (Recovery Point Objective): 1 day
- Test restore procedures monthly

